"code has **not yet been merged** into the vLLM-Ascend repository, source-"
"code installation is **not supported** for this model yet; please use the "
"Docker image as described in [4.1 Docker Image Installation](#41-docker-"
"image-installation)."
msgstr ""
"Hy4 Preview 目前通过 `quay.io/ascend/vllm-ascend:hy4-a3` Docker "
"镜像**开箱即用**。由于相关支持代码**尚未合并**到 vLLM-Ascend 仓库中，该模型目前**不支持**源码安装；请按照 [4.1 "
"Docker 镜像安装](#41-docker-image-installation) 中的说明使用 Docker 镜像。"

