msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点在线部署"

msgid ""
"A3 single-node TP=16 full-card inference is suitable for validation and low-"
"concurrency short-sequence scenarios. Execute the following after entering "
"the container interactive environment:"
msgstr "A3 单节点 TP=16 全卡推理适用于验证和低并发短序列场景。进入容器交互环境后执行以下命令："

msgid "### 5.2 Multi-Node Co-Located Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.2 多节点协同部署"

msgid ""
"DP=2 cross-machine deployment with TP=16 per node extends the context to "
"96K. Node 1 (Node1, demo IP `192.168.1.1`) hosts DP rank 0 and the API, and "
"Node 2 (Node2, demo IP `192.168.1.2`) is a headless worker. Both nodes share"
" the host network via `--net=host`. Use the same command as the A3 single-"
"node deployment, executed inside the container."
msgstr ""
"DP=2 跨机部署，每节点 TP=16，可将上下文扩展到 96K。节点1（Node1，示例 IP `192.168.1.1`）承载 DP rank 0 "
"和 API，节点2（Node2，示例 IP `192.168.1.2`）为无头工作节点。两个节点均通过 `--net=host` 共享主机网络。使用与 "
"A3 单节点部署相同的命令，在容器内执行。"

msgid "Startup order:"
msgstr "启动顺序："

msgid ""
"1. First execute the following script in the container on Node 1 (rank 0, including the API);\n"
"2. After seeing the `Started DP Coordinator process` log, execute the corresponding script in the container on Node 2;\n"
"3. After about 20 minutes, seeing `Application startup complete` indicates that the service is ready. The startup time is related to the disk read/write speed of the weights, etc."
msgstr ""
"1. 首先在节点1（rank 0，包含 API）的容器中执行以下脚本；\n"
"2. 看到 `Started DP Coordinator process` 日志后，在节点2的容器中执行相应的脚本；\n"
"3. 约20分钟后，看到 `Application startup complete` 表示服务已就绪。启动时间与权重的磁盘读写速度等因素有关。"

msgid "**Node 1 script:**"
msgstr "**节点1脚本：**"

msgid "**Node 2 script:**"
msgstr "**节点2脚本：**"

msgid ""
"> Note: `--data-parallel-address` is set to the local IP (i.e., the "
"coordinator) on Node 1, and to the head node IP on Node 2; `--data-parallel-"
"start-rank` is only set on the headless node."
msgstr ""
"> 注意：在节点1上，`--data-parallel-address` 设置为本地 IP（即协调器），在节点2上设置为头节点 IP；`--data-"
"parallel-start-rank` 仅在无头节点上设置。"

msgid ""
"Because the weights are large, the load time is related to the disk read "
